     "body": "<p>Test Notes:</p>\n\n<p>1) Create following test RELS-INT datastreams</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>verify triples expected are present in resource index</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>&lt;rdf:RDF xmlns:fedora-model=\"info:fedora/fedora-system:def/model#\" xmlns:ns=\"http://www.example.org/dummy#\" <br/>\nxmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1/DC\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test1&gt;test 1 literal&lt;/ns:test1&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1/DC\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test2 rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime\"&gt;2009-10-05T16:02:26&lt;/ns:test2&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1/DC\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test3 rdf:resource=\"info:fedora/changeme:1234\"/&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;rdf:Description rdf:about=\"info:fedora/changeme:1/DS1\"&gt;<br/>\n    &lt;ns:test4&gt;test 4 literal&lt;/ns:test4&gt;<br/>\n  &lt;/rdf:Description&gt;<br/>\n&lt;/rdf:RDF&gt;</p>\n\n\n<p>2) Validation - edit the rdf:about attribute for the first case above and change the PID part to \"changeme:1234\", save and check validation error produced</p>\n",
